From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [vllm, rollout] fix: MTP acceptance counts read from vLLM's
 per-request spec_decode_metrics

vLLM 0.34 no longer has RequestOutput.metrics.request_spec_decode_stats, so every MTP rollout skipped the acceptance
metrics. The engine now records each request's counts (--per-request-spec-decode-metrics summary) and the server reads
them from the finished output's spec_decode_metrics.
